Simple work hours tracker with companion Apple Watch & Today extensions for easy use.

Missed to click button in time? – No problems. Just correct your daily records later.

Have you worked too much this month? – Export report at the month end and show it to your employer!

Other features:
- dark & light colour schemas;
- report export in PDF format;
- choice of precision minutes/seconds;

Find this App helpful? – Write its short review on the App Store and share it with your friends. This will help us to continue work on it.

In case of any questions or feature request contact us within the App from the 'Other Apps' tab or through the contact form on our site: www.raptlook.com
